But the graph is defined as follows: two people are connected by an edge if their combined collection has all the stickers, i.e., they are a wholesome pair. Therefore, the complement graph would have an edge between two people if they are not wholesome. However, the coloring problem here is to color the graph so that adjacent vertices (wholesome pairs) have different colors. Therefore, the chromatic number of the original graph (wholesome pairs) is what we need.

